{title: 518 - Standing on the Promises}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #518 • STANDING ON THE PROMISES • 11.11.6.9}
{lyricist: R. Kelso Carter on}
{composer: R. Kelso Carter}
{key: Ab}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 518}
{meta: tune STANDING ON THE PROMISES}
{meta: meter 11.11.6.9}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab]Standing on the promises of Christ my King,
[Db]Thru eternal ages [Ab]let His praises ring;
[Ab]Bbm Eb7 Ab Db Ab Eb7
[Ab]Standing on the [Bbm/Db]promis-es [Eb7]of [Ab]God.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[Ab]Standing, standing,
[Db]Standing on the [Fm]promises
[Eb]of God my Savior;
[Ab]Standing, [Db/Ab]standing,
[Ab]I'm standing on [Db]the promises of God.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Ab]Standing on the promises that cannot fail,
[Db]When the howling storms of [Ab]doubt and fear assail,
[Ab]By the living word of God I shall prevail,
[Ab]Standing on the [Bbm/Db]promises [Eb7]of [Ab]God.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Ab]Standing on the promises of Christ the Lord,
[Db]Bound to Him eternally [Ab]by love's strong cord,
[Ab]Overcoming daily with the Spirit's sword,
[Ab]Standing on the [Bbm/Db]promises [Eb7]of [Ab]God.
{end_of_verse}
